[
  {
    "start": 6.771400966183576,
    "end": 10.32425120772947,
    "text": "AI 几秒钟就能解释“善假于物”。",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 10.352270531400968,
    "end": 11.898937198067634,
    "text": "可看懂了解释，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 11.92695652173913,
    "end": 12.689082125603864,
    "text": "我又冒出一个问题：",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.796135265700485,
    "end": 17.553236714975846,
    "text": "工具能帮我做到越来越多，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 17.76618357487923,
    "end": 19.82840579710145,
    "text": "那我自己，还要学什么？",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.73481081081081,
    "end": 24.025189189189188,
    "text": "君子曰：学不可以已。",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.881405405405406,
    "end": 27.635567567567566,
    "text": "青，取之于蓝，而青于蓝；",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.017297297297297,
    "end": 30.425405405405407,
    "text": "冰，水为之，而寒于水。",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 31.310162162162165,
    "end": 33.67189189189189,
    "text": "青出于蓝，水凝成冰。",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 34.04648648648649,
    "end": 35.91945945945946,
    "text": "学习，也应该让我发生变化。",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.83275675675676,
    "end": 38.91621621621621,
    "text": "我想试试：暂时不看屏幕，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 38.95545945945946,
    "end": 40.32897297297298,
    "text": "能不能把这句话讲清楚，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 40.52875675675676,
    "end": 41.442054054054054,
    "text": "再举一个自己的例子。",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 43.016306256860595,
    "end": 45.18660263446762,
    "text": "吾尝终日而思矣，",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 45.25834796926454,
    "end": 47.572135016465424,
    "text": "不如须臾之所学也；",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.069868276619104,
    "end": 49.78727222832053,
    "text": "吾尝跂而望矣，",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 49.86798572996707,
    "end": 52.01137760702525,
    "text": "不如登高之博见也。",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 53.09652579582876,
    "end": 55.75558726673985,
    "text": "登高而招，臂非加长也，",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 55.77800768386389,
    "end": 56.809346871569716,
    "text": "而见者远；",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 57.28017563117454,
    "end": 59.91681668496158,
    "text": "顺风而呼，声非加疾也，",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 59.93923710208563,
    "end": 61.07819429198683,
    "text": "而闻者彰。",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 62.26199231613612,
    "end": 65.26632821075741,
    "text": "登高，让我看见原来看不见的地方。",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 65.70576838638858,
    "end": 67.87606476399561,
    "text": "AI 也能帮我找资料、换个角度。",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 68.73700878155873,
    "end": 69.98358397365533,
    "text": "省下来的时间，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 70.01048847420418,
    "end": 72.64712952799123,
    "text": "我可以用来读原文、比较解释，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.73681119648738,
    "end": 74.42282656421516,
    "text": "把没想通的地方接着想。",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 75.49299071618037,
    "end": 77.76523209549072,
    "text": "假舆马者，非利足也，",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 77.81082891246685,
    "end": 78.92795092838196,
    "text": "而致千里；",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 79.18253315649868,
    "end": 81.27618700265252,
    "text": "假舟楫者，非能水也，",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 81.35218169761274,
    "end": 82.63649204244032,
    "text": "而绝江河。",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 83.34324270557029,
    "end": 85.15951591511937,
    "text": "君子生非异也，",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 85.22791114058356,
    "end": 86.89219496021221,
    "text": "善假于物也。",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 87.91812334217506,
    "end": 89.19483421750664,
    "text": "舟能帮我渡河，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 89.28602785145888,
    "end": 91.55826923076924,
    "text": "可桨怎样划，还得看水流。",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 92.10543103448276,
    "end": 93.30234748010609,
    "text": "看一看，调一调，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 93.32134615384615,
    "end": 94.78044429708223,
    "text": "才能朝想去的地方走。",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 95.06162466843502,
    "end": 96.25094164456233,
    "text": "原来，用好工具，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 96.26994031830239,
    "end": 97.01468832891246,
    "text": "本身也需要学习。",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 98.41675283732661,
    "end": 100.67150693568726,
    "text": "积土成山，风雨兴焉；",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 101.01505674653215,
    "end": 102.99964060529634,
    "text": "积水成渊，蛟龙生焉。",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 103.74677805800756,
    "end": 105.80807692307692,
    "text": "故不积跬步，无以至千里；",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 106.01820933165196,
    "end": 107.82267969735183,
    "text": "不积小流，无以成江海。",
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "start": 108.67655107187895,
    "end": 109.53042244640605,
    "text": "我在纸上写下：",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 109.6771815889029,
    "end": 111.35156998738965,
    "text": "“借助工具，能让人做到更多。”",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 112.14540353089534,
    "end": 113.7764312736444,
    "text": "又添上一句：“借助工具，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 113.79310844892812,
    "end": 115.11394073139977,
    "text": "也要把原来不会的东西学会。”",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 115.76768600252207,
    "end": 117.93238335435058,
    "text": "写到这里，我对“学不可以已”，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 117.94906052963431,
    "end": 118.64950189155107,
    "text": "有了新的理解。",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 119.59925788497218,
    "end": 120.66671614100187,
    "text": "我又读了一遍：",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 121.0282745825603,
    "end": 122.72415584415585,
    "text": "“君子生非异也，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 122.80163265306123,
    "end": 124.04126159554731,
    "text": "善假于物也。”",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.94946196660483,
    "end": 128.43161410018553,
    "text": "今天，我也可以借 AI 接触更多知识，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 128.53491651205937,
    "end": 129.5765491651206,
    "text": "尝试更多想法。",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 130.33410018552877,
    "end": 130.3900556586271,
    "text": "工具让更多事情成为可能，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 130.59235621521336,
    "end": 132.57231910946197,
    "text": "我想借今天的舟楫，",
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.68423005565862,
    "end": 134.8621892393321,
    "text": "去抵达昨天还到不了的地方。",
    "style": "Narration"
  }
]